// THE WILDERNESS FISHING SPOTS (13 October, moved east 15 October). Suggestion #10 asked for raw
// manta and sea turtle in the Wilderness by the dragons; until then both fish came from the Fishing
// Trawler and nowhere else - the skill guide said so out loud and the Fishing level-up messages at
// 79 and 81 told the player as much.
//
// WHERE (moved 15 October). Four spots along the coast east of the EAST dragons, on the water that
// runs down the east side of map square 52_57: (3379,3672), (3383,3678), (3385,3681) and
// (3387,3685), Wilderness 20 and 21. They were first put in the pond among the WEST dragons, and
// then - briefly - on a patch of `water_no_texture` west of this coast, which looks like dull
// ground in game, is not flagged as water and is not what anyone means by the water out here. The
// real thing is the tiles carrying the water OVERLAY (o6 in the map), all 721 of them already
// blocked by the cache, which is what the blue in the game is.
//
// IN THE WATER, ON THE EDGE, which is what every other fishing spot in the game is: the spot npc
// stands on a blocked water tile and the walkable tiles beside it are the bank. Check any cache
// spot and you will find the same shape - f1 under the npc, a neighbour without it - and all four
// of these sit on a stretch of bank you can walk to from the dragons without crossing a cliff
// (flood-filled from a dragon tile to prove it, rather than assumed).
//
// FOUR SPOTS, NOT ONE, because one spot is a queue. They are four to six tiles apart along the
// shore, so a taken one is a few steps from a free one.
//
// STILL STATIC: moverestrict=nomove and wanderrange=0, as every other spot in this build. A fishing
// spot that drifts is a fishing spot nobody can click twice; spread along a shoreline is what makes
// this read as a shoal, and it costs the player nothing.

[wildyfish]
name=Fishing spot
desc=I can see something big swimming in the water.
model1=compofishspot_8
vislevel=hide
readyanim=fishingspot_ready
walkanim=fishingspot_walk
minimap=no
op3=Harpoon
op5=hidden
wanderrange=0
moverestrict=nomove
category=wildyfish
